# ==============================================================================
# 專利師歷屆試題練習系統 (PA-Mock-Exam) - Git 忽略清單 (.gitignore)
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 相依性套件目錄 (Dependencies)
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/install-state.gz

# 2. 建置與輸出檔案 (Production Builds & Outputs)
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
out/
server.js

# 3. 快取與臨時暫存檔 (Caches & Temporary Files)
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.turbo/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
.temp/
.tmp/
temp/

# 4. 環境變數與機密資訊 (Environment & Secrets)
# 嚴格忽略所有 .env 實體檔案，但保留範本 .env.example 供協作參考
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt
!.env.example

# 5. 執行記錄檔 (Logs)
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# 6. 作業系統自動生成檔案 (OS Generated Files)
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
desktop.ini

# 7. IDE 與程式碼編輯器設定 (Editor & IDE)
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# 允許 VS Code 的推薦設定分享，但忽略個人暫存設定
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# 8. AI 輔助開發工具暫存 (AI & Agent Artifacts)
.gemini/
